  "sourceTitle": "Raw Mushroom Gravy",
  "sourceText": "Raw Mushroom Gravy\nBy: Carrie Barr\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:17am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup almonds, soaked for 12 hours\n1/2 cup water\n2 1/2 cups shiitake mushrooms\n1 teaspoon garlic clove (or ¼  powdered garlic)\nDash of Bragg Liquid Aminos\nWater, as necessary\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In food processor grind almonds fine. 2 Add remainder of ingredients and process to paste. 3 Add water as necessary.\n\nAbout\n\n\nFrom Halston Bruce",
